<p>Neural Edge Publishing produces case dossiers, books, and episodes that apply this method to real cases — not to entertain with speculation, but to give readers an honest read of what the evidence actually shows. Victims are named in life first.</p>
<p>The Leslie Preer case was solved, and a man pleaded guilty. This dossier shows you the anatomy of how the science got there.</p>
